Z||000000||bHooper||05-29-2001||11:19 AM||||ok, i washed the new SE today, and took her for a spin (to blow the remaining water off of her) and i heard this funny sound from the engine bay.  i swear it sounded similar to a power stearing pump going bad (which is imposible).  <P>could this be the torque converter?  what kind of sounds to they make?  i wasn't going very fast.<P>i have changed both the oil and tranny fluid (to dexron III), and filter.<P>::very concerned::<P><P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT 5 speed<BR>*Black '86 SE Automatic||||reg||1
